Z||000001||btoth||12-06-2000||04:47 PM||||I'd say anything with a big front end with plenty of space around the engine itself.  I learned a lot by watching my friend rebuild the engine his old Delray with an in-line 6.  I could fit in the engine compartment next to the engine.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Took a day to rebuild that thing.. my Fiero took a lot longer!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
